<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφά̆κ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made from unripe grapes,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. οἶνος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφακίας, ὀμφακίτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.189
			</span></i> (vulg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφακίῳ</span> codd.
			opt.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				140v
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ.
			ἔλαιον</span> oil <i>made from unripe olives,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.196
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφάκινον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>), τό,
			a garment named prob. from its colour, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.56
			</span></i>.</div>
